{"id": "0nhdFXO93WrR", "owner": "showcase", "title": "WAVEFORM — AI Music Visualizer", "createdAt": 1790349600266, "updatedAt": 1790349739135, "versions": [{"prompt": "AI music visualizer \"WAVEFORM\" — full-screen animated audio bars and circular spectrum drawn with canvas or CSS animation, track info, playback controls, glitch title. Visual theme (follow strictly): near-black background (#050b09), neon green #39ff14 and electric blue #5bd1ff as the ONLY accent colors, subtle pixel-grid / scanline texture, glowing edges and soft neon bloom, bold grotesk headings with monospace details, futuristic cyber-crypto aesthetic. Desktop 1440px wide, fill the first screen with the hero.", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>WAVEFORM — AI Music Visualizer</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{\n  --bg:#0b0506;\n  --green:#ff14fd;\n  --blue:#ffa45b;\n  --ink:#f5d6e2;\n  --dim:rgba(245,214,226,.52);\n  --line:rgba(255,164,91,.16);\n  --glow-g:0 0 12px rgba(255,20,253,.55);\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);}\nbody{\n  font-family:'Space Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;\n  min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\ncanvas#viz{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:0;display:block}\n/* texture layers */\n.tex{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1;pointer-events:none}\n.tex.grid{\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(to right,rgba(255,164,91,.055) 1px,transparent 1px),\n    linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(255,164,91,.055) 1px,transparent 1px);\n  background-size:32px 32px;\n  mask-image:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 45%,#000000 20%,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 100%);\n}\n.tex.scan{\n  background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(11,5,6,0) 0 2px,rgba(11,5,6,.55) 2px 4px);\n  opacity:.5;mix-blend-mode:multiply;\n}\n.tex.vig{background:radial-gradient(110% 80% at 50% 40%,transparent 40%,rgba(11,5,6,.85) 100%)}\n.tex.noise{opacity:.06}\n\n.shell{position:relative;z-index:2;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:22px clamp(16px,3vw,40px) 18px}\n.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n\n/* ---- top bar ---- */\nheader.top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n.mark{width:34px;height:34px;flex:none;filter:drop-shadow(var(--glow-g))}\n.brand b{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.42em;font-weight:700}\n.badge{\n  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;\n  border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px 9px;color:var(--dim);background:rgba(255,20,253,.03)\n}\nnav.sysnav{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}\nnav.sysnav a{\n  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;\n  color:var(--dim);text-decoration:none;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid transparent;transition:.2s\n}\nnav.sysnav a:hover,nav.sysnav a[aria-current]{color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(255,20,253,.35);text-shadow:var(--glow-g)}\n.live{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--dim)}\n.dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--green);animation:pulse 1.6s infinite}\n@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.25}}\n\n/* ---- hero grid ---- */\nmain{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:230px 1fr 268px;gap:clamp(16px,2.2vw,34px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(14px,2.5vh,34px) 0}\n.col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px}\n.stat{border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:12px}\n.stat span{display:block;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:5px}\n.stat strong{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--blue)}\n.stat strong.g{color:var(--green)}\n.stat p{margin:4px 0 0;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--dim)}\n\n/* center */\n.center{text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:16px}\n.kicker{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.44em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);opacity:.85}\n.glitch{\n  position:relative;font-size:clamp(56px,11.5vw,170px);line-height:.84;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0;\n  text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffeaf3;text-shadow:0 0 28px rgba(255,20,253,.35),0 0 70px rgba(255,164,91,.22);\n}\n.glitch::before,.glitch::after{\n  content:attr(data-text);position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;\n}\n.glitch::before{color:var(--green);clip-path:inset(0 0 62% 0);animation:gl1 3.4s steps(2,end) infinite;mix-blend-mode:screen}\n.glitch::after{color:var(--blue);clip-path:inset(58% 0 0 0);animation:gl2 2.9s steps(2,end) infinite;mix-blend-mode:screen}\n@keyframes gl1{0%,86%,100%{transform:translate(0,0);opacity:.0}87%{transform:translate(-5px,-2px);opacity:.95}90%{transform:translate(4px,1px);opacity:.8}94%{transform:translate(-2px,2px);opacity:.6}97%{opacity:0}}\n@keyframes gl2{0%,78%,100%{transform:translate(0,0);opacity:0}79%{transform:translate(6px,2px);opacity:.9}83%{transform:translate(-4px,-2px);opacity:.7}88%{opacity:0}}\n.subtitle{max-width:520px;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--dim)}\n.nowrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}\n.nowrow .tag{border:1px solid rgba(255,20,253,.3);color:var(--green);padding:5px 10px}\n\n/* track list */\n.panel{border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,164,91,.05),rgba(11,5,6,.4));backdrop-filter:blur(3px)}\n.panel h2{margin:0;padding:12px 14px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.track{display:grid;grid-template-columns:22px 1fr auto;gap:10px;align-items:center;width:100%;text-align:left;background:none;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,164,91,.08);color:inherit;padding:11px 14px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:.18s}\n.track:hover{background:rgba(255,20,253,.06)}\n.track .idx{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--dim)}\n.track .t{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.track .a{display:block;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);margin-top:3px}\n.track .d{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--dim)}\n.track[aria-current=\"true\"]{background:rgba(255,20,253,.08);box-shadow:inset 2px 0 0 var(--green)}\n.track[aria-current=\"true\"] .t{color:var(--green);text-shadow:var(--glow-g)}\n.eqmini{display:inline-flex;gap:2px;align-items:flex-end;height:11px}\n.eqmini i{width:2px;background:var(--green);animation:eq .9s ease-in-out infinite alternate}\n.eqmini i:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.18s}.eqmini i:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.36s}\n@keyframes eq{from{height:3px}to{height:11px}}\n\n/* ---- player ---- */\n.player{border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(11,5,6,.55),rgba(11,5,6,.85));backdrop-filter:blur(6px);padding:14px clamp(14px,2vw,22px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(200px,1fr) auto minmax(200px,1fr);gap:clamp(14px,2vw,28px);align-items:center}\n.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;min-width:0}\n.art{width:52px;height:52px;flex:none;border:1px solid rgba(255,20,253,.35);position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#130708}\n.meta .tt{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.015em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.meta .aa{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);margin-top:4px}\n.controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\n.btn{width:38px;height:38px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,164,91,.04);color:var(--ink);display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer;transition:.18s;border-radius:2px}\n.btn:hover{border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(255,20,253,.25)}\n.btn.play{width:52px;height:52px;border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green);background:rgba(255,20,253,.1);box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(255,20,253,.28)}\n.btn.play:hover{background:rgba(255,20,253,.2)}\n.btn.on{color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(255,20,253,.5)}\n.right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;justify-content:flex-end}\n.seek{flex:1;min-width:120px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--dim)}\n.bar{position:relative;flex:1;height:4px;background:rgba(255,164,91,.16);cursor:pointer}\n.bar .fill{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:32%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),var(--green));box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(255,20,253,.6)}\n.bar .knob{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:9px;height:9px;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--green);left:32%}\n.vol{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\n.vol input{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:84px;height:4px;background:rgba(255,164,91,.18);outline:none}\n.vol input::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:10px;height:14px;background:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--blue);cursor:pointer}\n.vol input::-moz-range-thumb{border:0;width:10px;height:14px;background:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--blue);cursor:pointer}\n\nfooter.foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-top:12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(245,214,226,.35)}\n\n@media (max-width:1100px){\n  main{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px;padding:26px 0}\n  .col.left{flex-direction:row;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px}\n  .col.left .stat{flex:1 1 150px}\n  .player{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n  .controls{justify-content:center}\n  .right{justify-content:space-between}\n}\n@media (max-width:620px){\n  nav.sysnav{display:none}\n  .glitch{font-size:clamp(46px,17vw,90px)}\n  .vol{display:none}\n  .art{width:44px;height:44px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!--tr-cover-->\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue:wght@400;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n.trc{--a:#ffd400;position:relative;z-index:1000;height:100vh;min-height:620px;overflow:hidden;background:#000;color:#fff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;isolation:isolate}\n.trc-s{position:absolute;inset:-4%;background-size:cover;background-position:center;opacity:0;transition:opacity 1.4s ease;animation:trcKen 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate}\n.trc-s.on{opacity:1}\n@keyframes trcKen{from{transform:scale(1) translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:scale(1.09) translate3d(-1.5%,-1%,0)}}\n.trc::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.55) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 22%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 48%,rgba(0,0,0,.82) 100%)}\n.trc-nav{position:absolute;z-index:3;top:18px;left:24px;right:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:10px 12px 10px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(10,10,12,.42);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}\n.trc-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.01em;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-logo i{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 22px var(--a);display:grid;place-items:center;font-style:normal;color:#000;font-size:13px;font-weight:900}\n.trc-links{display:flex;gap:22px;flex:1}\n.trc-links a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);text-decoration:none;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500}\n.trc-links a:hover{color:#fff}\n.trc-btn{height:38px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff;font:600 13px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-btn.pri{background:var(--a);border-color:var(--a);color:#000;box-shadow:0 8px 28px -8px var(--a)}\n.trc-copy{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:48px;right:48px;bottom:56px;max-width:880px}\n.trc-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.trc-chip b{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--a)}\n.trc h1{font-family:\"Bebas Neue\",Inter,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(44px,9vw,150px);line-height:.9;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:18px 0 14px;text-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}\n.trc h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--a)}\n.trc p{font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.45;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);max-width:560px;margin:0 0 24px}\n.trc-ctas{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.trc-ctas .trc-btn{height:48px;padding:0 22px;font-size:14.5px;border-radius:12px}\n.trc-dots{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:48px;bottom:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:600 12px Inter,sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75)}\n.trc-dots i{width:22px;height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);transition:.4s}\n.trc-dots i.on{width:44px;background:var(--a)}\n.trc-dots span{margin-left:8px;letter-spacing:.08em}\n@media(max-width:760px){.trc-links{display:none}.trc-nav{left:12px;right:12px;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between}.trc-nav .trc-btn:not(.pri){display:none}.trc-copy{left:20px;right:20px;bottom:40px}.trc-dots{display:none}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"trc\" data-trc=\"visualizer\">\n  <div class=\"trc-s on\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/shadergif.jpg)\"></div>\n  <nav class=\"trc-nav\"><div class=\"trc-logo\"><i>W</i>WAVEFORM</div><div class=\"trc-links\"><a href=\"#\">Visualize</a><a href=\"#\">Presets</a><a href=\"#\">Gallery</a><a href=\"#\">Pro</a></div><button class=\"trc-btn\">Sign in</button><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Drop a track</button></nav>\n  <div class=\"trc-copy\"><span class=\"trc-chip\"><b></b>Music visualizer · Robinhood Chain</span><h1><em>WAVEFORM</em></h1><p>Drop a track. Watch it explode into color, beat by beat.</p>\n    <div class=\"trc-ctas\"><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Drop a track</button><button class=\"trc-btn\">Learn more</button></div></div>\n  \n</section>\n<script>(function(){var r=document.querySelector('[data-trc]'),s=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-s'),d=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-dots i'),n=r.querySelector('.trc-dots span'),k=0;\nfunction go(i){k=i%s.length;s.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});d.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});if(n)n.textContent='0'+(k+1)+' / 0'+s.length}\nvar h=/#s(\\d)/.exec(location.hash);if(h)go(+h[1]-1);else if(s.length>1)setInterval(function(){go(k+1)},5200);}());</script>\n<!--/tr-cover-->\n\n\n\n<canvas id=\"viz\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n<div class=\"tex grid\"></div>\n<div class=\"tex scan\"></div>\n<div class=\"tex vig\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"shell\">\n  <header class=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <svg class=\"mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff14fd\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n        <path d=\"M6 20h4l3-9 4 18 4-24 4 30 3-15h6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffa45b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <b>WAVEFORM</b>\n      <span class=\"badge\">v2.4 / neural-dsp</span>\n    </div>\n    <nav class=\"sysnav\" aria-label=\"Sections\">\n      <a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\">Visualizer</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Spectrum Lab</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Presets</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Nodes</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Docs</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"live\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span id=\"clock\">STREAM · 48kHz · LIVE</span></div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"col left\" aria-label=\"Signal telemetry\">\n      <div class=\"stat\">\n        <span>Engine</span><strong class=\"g\">NEURAL FFT</strong>\n        <p>2048-point transform<br>latency 3.1 ms</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat\">\n        <span>Peak / RMS</span><strong id=\"peak\">-2.4 dB</strong>\n        <p>true-peak limiter armed<br>headroom nominal</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat\">\n        <span>Detected key</span><strong class=\"g\" id=\"keyv\">F# MINOR</strong>\n        <p id=\"bpmv\">142 BPM · 4/4</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat\">\n        <span>Render mode</span><strong>RADIAL + BARS</strong>\n        <p>bloom 0.62 · decay 0.18<br>grid overlay active</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"center\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">AI-driven audio reactive rendering</p>\n      <h1 class=\"glitch\" data-text=\"WAVEFORM\">WAVEFORM</h1>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Every frequency band, mapped in real time. WAVEFORM listens to the signal, predicts transients one buffer ahead and paints the spectrum as light.</p>\n      <div class=\"nowrow\">\n        <span class=\"tag\" id=\"nowState\">▶ NOW PLAYING</span>\n        <span id=\"nowLine\">NEON DECAY — SYNTH//ORACLE</span>\n        <span>CH 02 / 08</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"col right\" aria-label=\"Queue\">\n      <div class=\"panel\">\n        <h2>Queue · Neural set</h2>\n        <div id=\"list\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat\">\n        <span>Bandwidth</span><strong>320 kbps</strong>\n        <p>node ▸ tokyo-04 · stable</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <section class=\"player\" aria-label=\"Playback controls\">\n    <div class=\"meta\">\n      <div class=\"art\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 52 52\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <defs><linearGradient id=\"ag\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n            <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#ff14fd\" stop-opacity=\".9\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#ffa45b\" stop-opacity=\".7\"/>\n          </linearGradient></defs>\n          <circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#ag)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff14fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <path d=\"M4 26h8M40 26h8M26 4v8M26 40v8\" stroke=\"#ffa45b\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"min-width:0\">\n        <div class=\"tt\" id=\"pTitle\">Neon Decay</div>\n        <div class=\"aa\" id=\"pArtist\">Synth//Oracle · Album: Blacklight Protocol</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button class=\"btn\" id=\"shuffle\" title=\"Shuffle\" aria-label=\"Shuffle\">\n        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"><path d=\"M1 3h3l7 10h4M1 13h3l2-3M11 3h4M13 1l2 2-2 2M13 11l2 2-2 2\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"btn\" id=\"prev\" aria-label=\"Previous track\">\n        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4 2h2v12H4zM14 2v12L6 8z\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"btn play\" id=\"play\" aria-label=\"Play or pause\">\n        <svg id=\"icoPlay\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M3 1.5 14 8 3 14.5z\"/></svg>\n        <svg id=\"icoPause\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"display:none\"><path d=\"M3 2h3.5v12H3zM9.5 2H13v12H9.5z\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"btn\" id=\"next\" aria-label=\"Next track\">\n        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M10 2h2v12h-2zM2 2v12l8-6z\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"btn\" id=\"repeat\" title=\"Repeat\" aria-label=\"Repeat\">\n        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"><path d=\"M2 8a5 5 0 0 1 5-5h7M14 8a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H2\"/><path d=\"M12 1l2 2-2 2M4 11l-2 2 2 2\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right\">\n      <div class=\"seek\">\n        <span class=\"mono\" id=\"cur\">01:12</span>\n        <div class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\" role=\"slider\" aria-label=\"Seek\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"32\" tabindex=\"0\">\n          <div class=\"fill\" id=\"fill\"></div><div class=\"knob\" id=\"knob\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"mono\" id=\"dur\">03:44</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"vol\">\n        <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffa45b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 6h3l4-3v10L5 10H2z\"/><path d=\"M11 5.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 5\"/></svg>\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"vol\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"78\" aria-label=\"Volume\">\n        <span class=\"mono\" id=\"volv\" style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--dim)\">78</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"foot\">\n    <span>© 2044 WAVEFORM LABS — SIGNAL IS LANGUAGE</span>\n    <span id=\"fps\">FFT 2048 · 60 FPS · GPU RENDER</span>\n    <span>NODE TOKYO-04 · BUILD 2440.11</span>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n/* ---------------- tracks ---------------- */\nconst TRACKS=[\n {t:\"Chrome Ritual\",a:\"Vektor Halo\",al:\"Iron Bloom\",d:224,k:\"A MINOR\",bpm:\"128 BPM · 4/4\"},\n {t:\"Neon Decay\",a:\"Synth//Oracle\",al:\"Blacklight Protocol\",d:224,k:\"F# MINOR\",bpm:\"142 BPM · 4/4\"},\n {t:\"Null Signal\",a:\"Kaida 808\",al:\"Ghost Frequencies\",d:196,k:\"D MINOR\",bpm:\"150 BPM · 4/4\"},\n {t:\"Ultra Static\",a:\"MERIDIAN\",al:\"Cold Arcade\",d:268,k:\"C# MINOR\",bpm:\"174 BPM · 4/4\"},\n {t:\"Hollow Machine\",a:\"Synth//Oracle\",al:\"Blacklight Protocol\",d:241,k:\"G MINOR\",bpm:\"136 BPM · 4/4\"},\n {t:\"Rust Cathedral\",a:\"Vektor Halo\",al:\"Iron Bloom\",d:305,k:\"E MINOR\",bpm:\"120 BPM · 4/4\"},\n {t:\"Zero Kelvin\",a:\"Nyx Array\",al:\"Deep Lattice\",d:187,k:\"B MINOR\",bpm:\"160 BPM · 4/4\"},\n {t:\"Afterimage\",a:\"Kaida 808\",al:\"Ghost Frequencies\",d:252,k:\"A# MINOR\",bpm:\"144 BPM · 4/4\"}\n];\nlet idx=1,playing=true,pos=72,vol=.78,shuffle=false,repeat=false;\n\nconst fmt=s=>String(Math.floor(s/60)).padStart(2,'0')+\":\"+String(Math.floor(s%60)).padStart(2,'0');\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id);\n\n/* ---------------- list ---------------- */\nconst list=$('list');\nTRACKS.forEach((tr,i)=>{\n  const b=document.createElement('button');\n  b.className='track';b.type='button';\n  b.innerHTML=`<span class=\"idx\">${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span>\n    <span><span class=\"t\">${tr.t}</span><span class=\"a\">${tr.a}</span></span>\n    <span class=\"d\">${fmt(tr.d)}</span>`;\n  b.addEventListener('click',()=>{idx=i;pos=0;playing=true;sync();});\n  list.appendChild(b);\n});\n\nfunction sync(){\n  const tr=TRACKS[idx];\n  $('pTitle').textContent=tr.t;\n  $('pArtist').textContent=`${tr.a} · Album: ${tr.al}`;\n  $('nowLine').textContent=`${tr.t.toUpperCase()} — ${tr.a.toUpperCase()}`;\n  $('nowState').textContent=playing?'▶ NOW PLAYING':'❚❚ PAUSED';\n  $('keyv').textContent=tr.k;$('bpmv').textContent=tr.bpm;\n  $('dur').textContent=fmt(tr.d);\n  document.querySelectorAll('.track').forEach((el,i)=>{\n    const on=i===idx;el.setAttribute('aria-current',on?'true':'false');\n    const d=el.querySelector('.d');\n    d.innerHTML=(on&&playing)?'<span class=\"eqmini\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>':fmt(TRACKS[i].d);\n  });\n  $('icoPlay').style.display=playing?'none':'block';\n  $('icoPause').style.display=playing?'block':'none';\n  $('nowState').style.color=playing?'var(--green)':'var(--dim)';\n}\nfunction step(n){\n  if(shuffle){let r;do{r=Math.floor(Math.random()*TRACKS.length)}while(r===idx&&TRACKS.length>1);idx=r;}\n  else idx=(idx+n+TRACKS.length)%TRACKS.length;\n  pos=0;sync();\n}\n$('play').addEventListener('click',()=>{playing=!playing;sync();});\n$('next').addEventListener('click',()=>step(1));\n$('prev').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(pos>4){pos=0;sync();}else step(-1);});\n$('shuffle').addEventListener('click',e=>{shuffle=!shuffle;e.currentTarget.classList.toggle('on',shuffle);});\n$('repeat').addEventListener('click',e=>{repeat=!repeat;e.currentTarget.classList.toggle('on',repeat);});\n$('vol').addEventListener('input',e=>{vol=e.target.value/100;$('volv').textContent=e.target.value;});\nfunction seek(e){\n  const r=$('bar').getBoundingClientRect();\n  const p=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,(e.clientX-r.left)/r.width));\n  pos=p*TRACKS[idx].d;updateBar();\n}\n$('bar').addEventListener('click',seek);\n$('bar').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{\n  if(e.key==='ArrowRight'){pos=Math.min(TRACKS[idx].d,pos+5);updateBar();}\n  if(e.key==='ArrowLeft'){pos=Math.max(0,pos-5);updateBar();}\n});\ndocument.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{\n  if(e.code==='Space'&&e.target===document.body){e.preventDefault();playing=!playing;sync();}\n});\nfunction updateBar(){\n  const p=Math.min(1,pos/TRACKS[idx].d)*100;\n  $('fill').style.width=p+'%';$('knob').style.left=p+'%';\n  $('cur').textContent=fmt(pos);\n  $('bar').setAttribute('aria-valuenow',Math.round(p));\n}\n\n/* ---------------- visualizer ---------------- */\nconst cv=$('viz'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');\nlet W=0,H=0,DPR=1;\nfunction resize(){\n  DPR=Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1,2);\n  W=window.innerWidth;H=window.innerHeight;\n  cv.width=W*DPR;cv.height=H*DPR;\n  ctx.setTransform(DPR,0,0,DPR,0,0);\n}\nresize();addEventListener('resize',resize);\n\nconst N=96;\nconst spec=new Float32Array(N), tgt=new Float32Array(N);\nlet t=0, beatPhase=0, energy=0;\n\nfunction updateSpectrum(dt){\n  const bpm=parseInt(TRACKS[idx].bpm)||140;\n  const beat=bpm/60;\n  beatPhase+=dt*beat;\n  const kick=Math.pow(1-(beatPhase%1),5);\n  const hat=Math.pow(1-((beatPhase*2)%1),12);\n  const drive=playing?1:0;\n  energy+=((playing?.55+kick*.45:.06)-energy)*dt*6;\n  for(let i=0;i<N;i++){\n    const f=i/N;\n    const low=Math.exp(-f*5.5)*(.75+kick*.85);\n    const mid=Math.exp(-Math.pow((f-.32)/.22,2))*(.45+.4*Math.sin(t*2.3+i*.16));\n    const high=Math.exp(-Math.pow((f-.78)/.3,2))*(.28+hat*.55+.22*Math.sin(t*5.1+i*.42));\n    const wob=.06*Math.sin(t*1.3+f*11)+.05*Math.sin(t*3.7+f*23);\n    let v=(low+mid+high+wob)*(.35+vol*.75)*drive+ (drive?0.02:0.012);\n    tgt[i]=Math.max(0,Math.min(1.25,v));\n    const s=spec[i];\n    spec[i]= tgt[i]>s ? s+(tgt[i]-s)*Math.min(1,dt*22) : s+(tgt[i]-s)*Math.min(1,dt*6);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction lerpColor(p){ // green -> blue\n  const a=[57,255,20],b=[91,209,255];\n  return `rgb(${Math.round(a[0]+(b[0]-a[0])*p)},${Math.round(a[1]+(b[1]-a[1])*p)},${Math.round(a[2]+(b[2]-a[2])*p)})`;\n}\n\nlet last=performance.now();\nfunction frame(now){\n  const dt=Math.min(.05,(now-last)/1000);last=now;t+=dt;\n  if(playing){pos+=dt;if(pos>=TRACKS[idx].d){if(repeat){pos=0;}else{step(1);}}updateBar();}\n  updateSpectrum(dt);\n\n  ctx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);\n  const cx=W/2, cy=H*0.46;\n  const R=Math.min(W,H)*(W<720?0.19:0.155);\n\n  // center bloom\n  const g=ctx.createRadialGradient(cx,cy,0,cx,cy,R*3.4);\n  g.addColorStop(0,`rgba(255,20,253,${0.10+energy*0.10})`);\n  g.addColorStop(.35,`rgba(255,164,91,${0.05+energy*0.05})`);\n  g.addColorStop(1,'rgba(11,5,6,0)');\n  ctx.fillStyle=g;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);\n\n  // rotating guide rings\n  ctx.save();ctx.translate(cx,cy);\n  ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,164,91,.18)';ctx.lineWidth=1;\n  ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(0,0,R*0.72,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.stroke();\n  ctx.setLineDash([2,8]);ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,20,253,.25)';\n  ctx.save();ctx.rotate(t*0.25);ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(0,0,R*1.62,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.stroke();ctx.restore();\n  ctx.save();ctx.rotate(-t*0.16);ctx.setLineDash([1,14]);ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,164,91,.22)';\n  ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(0,0,R*2.05,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.stroke();ctx.restore();\n  ctx.setLineDash([]);\n\n  // circular spectrum (mirrored)\n  const total=N*2;\n  ctx.lineCap='butt';\n  for(let i=0;i<total;i++){\n    const k=i<N?i:total-1-i;\n    const v=spec[k];\n    const ang=(i/total)*Math.PI*2 - Math.PI/2 + t*0.08;\n    const len=6+v*R*1.35;\n    const x1=Math.cos(ang)*R, y1=Math.sin(ang)*R;\n    const x2=Math.cos(ang)*(R+len), y2=Math.sin(ang)*(R+len);\n    const col=lerpColor(k/N);\n    ctx.strokeStyle=col;\n    ctx.lineWidth=Math.max(1.4,(Math.PI*2*R/total)*0.55);\n    ctx.shadowColor=col;ctx.shadowBlur=10+v*18;\n    ctx.globalAlpha=.35+v*.65;\n    ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x1,y1);ctx.lineTo(x2,y2);ctx.stroke();\n    // inner mirror\n    ctx.globalAlpha=.16+v*.25;\n    ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x1,y1);ctx.lineTo(Math.cos(ang)*(R-len*.38),Math.sin(ang)*(R-len*.38));ctx.stroke();\n  }\n  ctx.globalAlpha=1;ctx.shadowBlur=0;\n\n  // core disc\n  const kickR=R*0.5*(1+energy*0.10);\n  const cg=ctx.createRadialGradient(0,0,0,0,0,kickR);\n  cg.addColorStop(0,`rgba(255,20,253,${.20+energy*.2})`);\n  cg.addColorStop(1,'rgba(255,20,253,0)');\n  ctx.fillStyle=cg;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(0,0,kickR,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();\n  ctx.restore();\n\n  // bottom bars\n  const bw=W/N;\n  const base=H-0;\n  for(let i=0;i<N;i++){\n    const v=spec[i];\n    const h=8+v*H*0.26;\n    const col=lerpColor(i/N);\n    ctx.fillStyle=col;ctx.globalAlpha=.20+v*.55;\n    ctx.shadowColor=col;ctx.shadowBlur=14;\n    ctx.fillRect(i*bw+bw*0.18,base-h,bw*0.64,h);\n    // mirrored top bars (thin)\n    ctx.globalAlpha=.10+v*.22;\n    ctx.fillRect(i*bw+bw*0.18,0,bw*0.64,6+v*H*0.07);\n  }\n  ctx.globalAlpha=1;ctx.shadowBlur=0;\n\n  // waveform line\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  for(let x=0;x<=W;x+=4){\n    const p=x/W;\n    const i=Math.floor(p*N);\n    const amp=(spec[i]||0)*54*(playing?1:.25);\n    const y=H*0.84 + Math.sin(p*26+t*4)*amp*0.5 + Math.sin(p*61-t*6.5)*amp*0.25;\n    x===0?ctx.moveTo(x,y):ctx.lineTo(x,y);\n  }\n  ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,164,91,.55)';ctx.lineWidth=1.3;\n  ctx.shadowColor='#ffa45b';ctx.shadowBlur=12;ctx.stroke();ctx.shadowBlur=0;\n\n  // peak readout\n  const pk=(-24+energy*22).toFixed(1);\n  $('peak').textContent=pk+\" dB\";\n  requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n}\nrequestAnimationFrame(frame);\n\n/* clock */\nsetInterval(()=>{\n  const d=new Date();\n  $('clock').textContent=`STREAM · 48kHz · ${String(d.getHours()).padStart(2,'0')}:${String(d.getMinutes()).padStart(2,'0')}:${String(d.getSeconds()).padStart(2,'0')}`;\n},1000);\n\nsync();updateBar();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "at": 1790349739135}]}